{"seq":2,"slug":"business-and-culture","title":"商业与文化影响","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/steve-jobs/influence-and-legacy/business-and-culture","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-apple-business-model","title":"苹果的商业模式","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/steve-jobs/influence-and-legacy/business-and-culture/the-apple-business-model","wordCount":1819,"readingTime":8},{"seq":2,"slug":"a-cultural-icon","title":"一个文化偶像","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/steve-jobs/influence-and-legacy/business-and-culture/a-cultural-icon","wordCount":1713,"readingTime":7}],"introMarkdown":"# 商业与文化影响\n\n乔布斯的遗产，既体现在他锻造的商业模式上，也体现在他作为文化偶像的象征意义上。本章探讨这两个层面的影响。\n\n第一篇文档讲述\"苹果的商业模式\"——他如何以整合、溢价与生态为核心，把苹果推上市值之巅，并影响整个科技商业逻辑。第二篇文档讲述\"一个文化偶像\"，解读他如何超越企业家身份，成为深入人心的创新精神象征。\n"}